{"id":"cebafbaa76b53fc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-derived-category.md","title":"Derived Category","display":"df-derived-category — Derived Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-derived-category","aliases":["58-df-derived-category"],"display":"df-derived-category — Derived Category","depends_on":["[[58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md]]","[[58-df-category-localization-data.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-derived-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-derived-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derived-category — Derived Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c546da437a9d3842\" href=\"?note=c546da437a9d3842\" title=\"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md\">58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"79f72f51c5df5713\" href=\"?note=79f72f51c5df5713\" title=\"58-df-category-localization-data.md\">58-df-category-localization-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,K,D\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,K,D\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 使用原有集合编码的阿贝尔范畴。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(K_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C&#39;}\">\\([f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C&#39;}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c546da437a9d3842\" href=\"?note=c546da437a9d3842\" title=\"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md\">58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md</a>；复形次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 为二元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 为三元谓词，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"79f72f51c5df5713\" href=\"?note=79f72f51c5df5713\" title=\"58-df-category-localization-data.md\">58-df-category-localization-data.md</a> 的显式泛性质。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> 保留二元接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{\\mathcal A}(K)\">\\(W_{\\mathcal A}(K)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> 下定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category\\text{-}weak\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\to\nW_{\\mathcal A}(K)\\coloneqq\\\\\n\\left\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(K):\n\\exists C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\n\\left(a=\\langle C,C&#39;,[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C&#39;}\\rangle_3\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,C&#39;,\\mathcal A)\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category\\text{-}weak\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\to\nW_{\\mathcal A}(K)\\coloneqq\\\\\n\\left\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(K):\n\\exists C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\n\\left(a=\\langle C,C&#39;,[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C&#39;}\\rangle_3\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,C&#39;,\\mathcal A)\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W_{\\mathcal A}(K))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W_{\\mathcal A}(K))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对一般阿贝尔范畴取整数次数链复形的同伦范畴，再反转由拟同构代表的箭头类。</li>\n<li>原有仅适用于阿贝尔群底集及逐次数函数的五元拟同构接口不再误用到抽象范畴对象或链同伦类上；该上游接口自身没有改动。</li>\n<li>局部化按明确的函子和自然变换泛性质规定，仍允许等价的局部化模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c546da437a9d3842","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category-localization-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"79f72f51c5df5713","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category-localization-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c546da437a9d3842","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_{\\mathcal A}$、$\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}$、$\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}$、$[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C'}$ 及 $\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S$ 来自 [[58-df-chain-homotopy-category-data.md]]；复形次数为 $\\mathbb Z$。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category-localization-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"79f72f51c5df5713","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 为二元谓词；$\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 为三元谓词，采用 [[58-df-category-localization-data.md]] 的显式泛性质。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,K,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"K_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"W_{\\mathcal A}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category\\text{-}weak\\text{-}equivalences}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\to\nW_{\\mathcal A}(K)\\coloneqq\\\\\n\\left\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(K):\n\\exists C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A)^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\n\\left(a=\\langle C,C',[f]^{\\mathcal A}_{C,C'}\\rangle_3\n\\land\\mathrm{ZChainQuasiIsomorphism}_S(f,C,C',\\mathcal A)\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derived\\text{-}category}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{DerivedCategory}_S(D,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\exists K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(K,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W_{\\mathcal A}(K))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2487,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-416","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-derived-category.md|58-df-derived-category]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["c546da437a9d3842","79f72f51c5df5713","2aed7ac2ed3313e0"]}